        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml componentes\ntitle Diagrama de Componentes - SetlistGen\nskinparam componentStyle uml2\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam nodesep 45\nskinparam ranksep 45\n\ntop to bottom direction\n\nactor \&quot;DJ\&quot; as DJ\n\npackage \&quot;Sistema SetlistGen\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;Interfaz de Usuario\\n(Propuesta: Escritorio / Web local)\&quot; as UI\n\n  interface \&quot;IExportacion\&quot; as IEXP\n  interface \&quot;IGeneracion\&quot; as IGEN\n  interface \&quot;IAnalisis\&quot; as IANA_BIB\n\n  component \&quot;Exportación\\n(.m3u / .m3u8 o carpeta local)\&quot; as EX &lt;&lt;opcional&gt;&gt;\n  component \&quot;Generador de Setlists\\n(Cálculo armónico y edición flexible)\&quot; as GS\n  component \&quot;Analizador de Bibliotecas\\n(Estadísticas, metadatos, BPM y tonalidad)\&quot; as AB\n\n  interface \&quot;IRepositorio\&quot; as IREP\n\n  component \&quot;Persistencia\&quot; as PE\n}\n\ninterface \&quot;IAnalizadorMIR\&quot; as IMIR\ncomponent \&quot;Motor MIR\\n(Essentia / librosa)\&quot; as MIR &lt;&lt;librería externa&gt;&gt;\ndatabase \&quot;SQLite\\n(Rutas y descriptores)\&quot; as DB\n\n&#39; Actor\nDJ -down-&gt; UI : usa\n\n&#39; Fila 1 -&gt; Fila 2 (en orden estricto izquierda a derecha)\nUI -[dashed]down-( IEXP\nUI -down-( IGEN\nUI -down-( IANA_BIB\n\nIEXP -down- EX\nIGEN -down- GS\nIANA_BIB -down- AB\n\n&#39; Fila 2 -&gt; Persistencia (convergen limpiamente desde abajo)\nEX -[dashed]down-( IREP\nGS -down-( IREP\nAB -down-( IREP\n\nIREP -down- PE\n\n&#39; Conexión externa limpia a la derecha (sin cruzar nada)\nAB -right-( IMIR\nIMIR -right- MIR\n\n&#39; Base de datos abajo\nPE -down-&gt; DB : &lt;&lt;sqlite3&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="am1cfRPmvDg1gbZgeSVR-178">
